('director_heading','Director\'s Message'),
('director_name','Mr. Yusuph Majid Nassor'),
('director_title','Director General'),
('director_message','Thank you for visiting our website. On behalf of the Board of Directors and Management Team, it is our distinguished pleasure to welcome you. We are committed to delivering the highest standards of quality and safety in every project we undertake.\n\nWe believe in building lasting relationships through trust, transparency, and professionalism. Our team works tirelessly to ensure that every client receives solutions that are not only effective but also sustainable and responsible.\n\nWe hope you find our website helpful and look forward to working with you.');
